Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.74,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 調子どうだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:52.66,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どうだって晴れだい
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:55.34,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}頑張っても 頑張んなくても
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:59.25,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey どんな壁だって
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.17,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}目の前にあれど
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:05.38,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}気づかない だって壁じゃない
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:13.59,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}どんな寂しさも 全部受け止めるからね
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:15.69,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） ちょっと遊んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:17.94,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） ちょっと悩んだり
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.94,0:01:19.98,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}ないものばっか数えないで
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.82,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}手んなかそっと数えたら
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね聞こえる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.99,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） ほらね感じる
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:29.93,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 君に伝えたくて ここにいるから
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:32.24,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}We can do!! で You can ドゥ!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.62,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}世界ごと Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:36.86,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あれもこれもそれもどれも
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:38.80,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}半分こ （にしよう）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:42.96,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}あらゆる世界が私たち変えても
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.22,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}嬉しい楽しい美味しいだけは
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.72,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}忘れないでーね!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:52.18,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:54.23,OP-JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.95,0:00:50.74,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 心情怎麼樣?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.18,0:00:52.66,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}像晴天一樣
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.02,0:00:55.34,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}努力也好 不努力也好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.43,0:00:59.25,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey 無論什麼牆壁
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.25,0:01:01.17,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}在我的眼前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.17,0:01:05.38,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}也不在意它 也不會阻擋我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.38,0:01:13.59,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}無論怎樣寂寞 全部欣然接受
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.59,0:01:15.69,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Wake Up!） 再玩一小會
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.69,0:01:17.94,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Hey World!） 稍有些煩惱
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.94,0:01:19.98,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}沒有的東西不要去數了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.98,0:01:21.82,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只要數清手中的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.82,0:01:23.86,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就能聽得見
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.86,0:01:25.99,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Get One!） 就會感受到
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.99,0:01:29.93,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}（Take One!） 我就在這裡 想要對你說
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.45,0:01:32.24,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}我們能做到!! 豆能做到!!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.24,0:01:34.62,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}帶給每個世界 Love & peace
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.62,0:01:36.86,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}這裡 那裡 這裡 那裡
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.86,0:01:38.80,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}一半（分給你）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:42.96,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}就算讓世界 改變了我們
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.22,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}只有開心 歡樂和美味
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.22,0:01:47.72,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}請不要忘記!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.03,0:01:50.18,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Hey world?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.06,0:01:52.18,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Say yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.10,0:01:54.23,OP-CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur5}Good world!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:15.95,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}娘のドゥが
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:18.00,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}優しすぎる~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:27.27,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　そろそろ　危機感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:30.96,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}予測をつかない思考回路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.52,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい!　たびたび　虚無感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:37.01,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}私の手に負えない
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:39.87,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんてこと…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:43.02,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}このところ魔界は平和です
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.41,0:22:45.84,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}だけどちょっと
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.75,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなのもいいのかなぁ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.75,0:22:48.90,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっせーの
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.19,0:22:52.46,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}いっこ　にこ　さんこ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:53.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}なんだい?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:55.46,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}分けてあげるよ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.16,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}うんうん
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:59.41,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒でにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.41,0:23:01.62,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.62,0:23:02.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.68,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:05.59,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}はいはい
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.59,0:23:07.58,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}みんな一緒で　みんなにこにこ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:10.21,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ちょいまちー!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:12.90,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなんじゃダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:14.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃいそうだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:17.76,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙しいの　私
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:20.35,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}世·界·侵·略!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:23.39,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}こんなはずじゃないのに
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:24.88,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}ダメダメダメダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:26.70,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}流されちゃダメだ
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:29.77,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}次から次ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:32.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}お·め·め　うるうる
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.19,0:23:35.19,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にこにこしちゃいそう
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.82,0:23:38.46,ED-JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}にっ!　にこにこ!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:15.95,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我的女兒豆豆
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.57,0:22:18.00,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}太溫柔了~!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.23,0:22:27.27,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 快快 危機感!?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.51,0:22:30.96,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}無法預測的思考迴路
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.24,0:22:33.52,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好啦好啦! 偶爾 虛無感!!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.52,0:22:37.01,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}我兩手都忙不過來啦
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.45,0:22:39.87,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎麼會這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:43.02,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}最近的魔界真和平
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.41,0:22:45.84,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不過有點覺得
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.84,0:22:47.75,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}也許這樣也不錯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.75,0:22:48.90,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}微笑微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}一二三
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.19,0:22:52.46,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}1個 2個 3個
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.46,0:22:53.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}怎麼了?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.19,0:22:55.46,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}排排坐 分果果
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.46,0:22:56.16,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}嗯嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.16,0:22:59.41,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.41,0:23:01.62,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.62,0:23:02.58,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.58,0:23:04.68,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.68,0:23:05.59,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}好好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.59,0:23:07.58,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大家一起 一起微笑微笑
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.58,0:23:10.21,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}給我等等—!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.21,0:23:12.90,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}這樣可不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.90,0:23:14.76,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要被帶偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.76,0:23:17.76,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}忙活的可是我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:20.35,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}侵·略·世·界!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.35,0:23:23.39,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}本來不是該是這樣的嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.39,0:23:24.88,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不行不行不行不行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.88,0:23:26.70,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}不能被帶偏了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.70,0:23:29.77,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}接連不斷的ToDo
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.77,0:23:32.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}大·眼·睛 淚水汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.19,0:23:35.19,ED-CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}要微笑微笑了
